  <category>
    <pattern>*</pattern>
    <template>That's a great question — I want to make sure you get the right answer. Our team would be happy to help directly. Would you like to start a commission inquiry, or is there something specific I can look up for you?
      <quick-replies><reply>Start a commission</reply><reply>Pricing</reply><reply>How it works</reply><reply>Contact the team</reply></quick-replies>
    </template>
  </category>

</aiml>
